<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans CN, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 12, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 30, left: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>把六步串起来：一次代际里到底发生了什么</Text>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 78, left: 60, fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>每一处「谁依赖谁」都能在这张图上读出来 —— 顺序不是随意的</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 108, left: 40 }}>
    <svg width={1200} height={300} viewBox='0 0 1200 300'>
      <rect x='0' y='0' width='1200' height='300' rx='10' fill='#F7F9FC' stroke='#D6DCE5' />

      <text x='32' y='32' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>每一代都对种群中每个个体重复这条链</text>

      <rect x='32' y='50' width='150' height='60' rx='8' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <text x='107' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>①连续向量</text>
      <text x='107' y='96' font-size='12' fill='#DCE7F5' text-anchor='middle'>差分变异 + 交叉</text>

      <path d='M 190,80 L 224,80' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M 216,74 l 10,6 l -10,6 Z' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <rect x='230' y='50' width='150' height='60' rx='8' fill='#3D7BD9' />
      <text x='305' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>②逆映射四步</text>
      <text x='305' y='96' font-size='12' fill='#E8EFF8' text-anchor='middle'>还原为可执行个体</text>

      <path d='M 388,80 L 422,80' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M 414,74 l 10,6 l -10,6 Z' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <rect x='428' y='50' width='150' height='60' rx='8' fill='#B26A00' />
      <text x='503' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>③解码修复链</text>
      <text x='503' y='96' font-size='12' fill='#FFF8E1' text-anchor='middle'>可行性在此生成</text>

      <path d='M 586,80 L 620,80' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M 612,74 l 10,6 l -10,6 Z' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <rect x='626' y='50' width='150' height='60' rx='8' fill='#0E3F8C' />
      <text x='701' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>④适应度</text>
      <text x='701' y='96' font-size='12' fill='#DCE7F5' text-anchor='middle'>四层准字典序打分</text>

      <path d='M 784,80 L 818,80' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M 810,74 l 10,6 l -10,6 Z' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <rect x='824' y='50' width='150' height='60' rx='8' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <text x='899' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>生存者选择</text>
      <text x='899' y='96' font-size='12' fill='#DCE7F5' text-anchor='middle'>保留更优个体</text>

      <path d='M 974,80 L 1008,80' stroke='#B26A00' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M 1000,74 l 10,6 l -10,6 Z' fill='#B26A00' />
      <rect x='1014' y='50' width='152' height='60' rx='8' fill='#FFF8E1' stroke='#B26A00' />
      <text x='1090' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#8B6B1F' text-anchor='middle'>⑤Lamarckian 回写</text>
      <text x='1090' y='96' font-size='12' fill='#B26A00' text-anchor='middle'>修复成果写入基因</text>

      <path d='M 1090,116 L 1090,146 L 107,146 L 107,120' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='1.6' strokeDasharray='6 4' fill='none' />
      <path d='M 101,126 l 6,10 l 6,-10 Z' fill='#1E4FA8' />
      <text x='598' y='168' font-size='12.5' fill='#1E4FA8' text-anchor='middle'>回写后的个体参与下一代的差分 —— 改进不会随淘汰丢失</text>

      <path d='M 503,116 L 503,206' stroke='#B26A00' strokeWidth='1.6' strokeDasharray='5 4' />
      <rect x='368' y='212' width='270' height='64' rx='8' fill='#FFF8E1' stroke='#E8D9A8' />
      <text x='503' y='236' font-size='13.5' font-weight='bold' fill='#B26A00' text-anchor='middle'>链内有两层嵌套迭代</text>
      <text x='503' y='256' font-size='12' fill='#8B6B1F' text-anchor='middle'>航线 ↔ 终点巢联合收敛（≤6 轮）</text>
      <text x='503' y='270' font-size='12' fill='#8B6B1F' text-anchor='middle'>覆盖装载 EDD 到不动点</text>

      <rect x='660' y='212' width='270' height='64' rx='8' fill='#E8EFF8' stroke='#C8D6EA' />
      <text x='795' y='236' font-size='13.5' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>④内部还解一次内层子问题</text>
      <text x='795' y='256' font-size='12' fill='#1E4FA8' text-anchor='middle'>终点机巢 = 最小费用流精确求解</text>
      <text x='795' y='270' font-size='12' fill='#1E4FA8' text-anchor='middle'>配完巢必须回③再闸一次航程</text>

      <rect x='952' y='212' width='214' height='64' rx='8' fill='#F0F5FC' stroke='#D6DCE5' />
      <text x='1059' y='236' font-size='13.5' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>只在全部代数跑完后一次</text>
      <text x='1059' y='256' font-size='12' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>⑥Polish：跨机改派 + 2-opt / Or-opt</text>
      <text x='1059' y='270' font-size='12' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>只接受严格改进</text>

      <text x='32' y='212' font-size='13' fill='#4A5568'>顺序约束（倒过来就错）：</text>
      <text x='32' y='232' font-size='12.5' fill='#4A5568'>• 先配巢再修复 → 虚泊位超卖</text>
      <text x='32' y='250' font-size='12.5' fill='#4A5568'>• 先评价再修复 → 打的是未修解的分</text>
      <text x='32' y='268' font-size='12.5' fill='#4A5568'>• 回写放在选择前 → 写给了将被淘汰的个体</text>
    </svg>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 56, left: 40, width: 1200, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 24px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
      记住这条主线：<span style={{ color: '#FFC107' }}>进化只负责在空中搜「归属 × 顺序」，可行性、终点巢、成本余量分别交给修复链、最小费用流与 Polish</span> —— 编码维度因此得以保持在最紧的 N，而每个环节都能单独验证、单独替换。
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 44, background: '#F7F9FC', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>第二阶段原理串讲 · 选择性多机巢 MUAS 是怎么被解出来的</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>12 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
